      "global_end_sec": 330.078,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "PPT做好了",
      "spoken": "PPT 做好了，",
      "from": 55,
      "to": 92,
      "local_start_sec": 1.799,
      "global_start_sec": 330.078,
      "global_end_sec": 331.353,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "能翻页",
      "spoken": "能翻页；",
      "from": 93,
      "to": 120,
      "local_start_sec": 3.074,
      "global_start_sec": 331.353,
      "global_end_sec": 332.278,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "海报也出来了",
      "spoken": "海报也出来了；",
      "from": 121,
      "to": 160,
      "local_start_sec": 3.998,
      "global_start_sec": 332.278,
      "global_end_sec": 333.616,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "纪要呢",
      "spoken": "纪要呢，",
      "from": 161,
      "to": 184,
      "local_start_sec": 5.336,
      "global_start_sec": 333.616,
      "global_end_sec": 334.403,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "它不只是把声音转成文字",
      "spoken": "它不只是把声音转成文字，",
      "from": 185,
      "to": 243,
      "local_start_sec": 6.123,
      "global_start_sec": 334.403,
      "global_end_sec": 336.378,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "还把结论和行动事项挑了出来",
      "spoken": "还把结论和行动事项挑了出来，",
      "from": 244,
      "to": 316,
      "local_start_sec": 8.098,
      "global_start_sec": 336.378,
      "global_end_sec": 338.816,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "谁负责、什么时候截止",
      "spoken": "谁负责、什么时候截止，",
      "from": 317,
      "to": 377,
      "local_start_sec": 10.536,
      "global_start_sec": 338.816,
      "global_end_sec": 340.853,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "都列清楚了",
      "spoken": "都列清楚了。",
      "from": 378,
      "to": 417,
      "local_start_sec": 12.573,
      "global_start_sec": 340.853,
      "global_end_sec": 342.191,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "录音里没说明白的",
      "spoken": "录音里没说明白的，",
      "from": 418,
      "to": 469,
      "local_start_sec": 13.911,
      "global_start_sec": 342.191,
      "global_end_sec": 343.916,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "它就标成\"待确认\"",
      "spoken": "它就标成 \"待确认\"，",
      "from": 470,
      "to": 516,
      "local_start_sec": 15.636,
      "global_start_sec": 343.916,
      "global_end_sec": 345.466,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "不瞎猜",
      "spoken": "不瞎猜。",
      "from": 517,
      "to": 553,
      "local_start_sec": 17.186,
      "global_start_sec": 345.466,
      "global_end_sec": 346.716,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "三件事都办完了",
      "spoken": "三件事都办完了，",
      "from": 554,
      "to": 604,
      "local_start_sec": 18.436,
      "global_start_sec": 346.716,
      "global_end_sec": 348.416,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "确认没问题",
